{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他此刻在乎的是一份想靠近某个人的心意能否被完整地留在当下：最先出现的冲动很明确，但很快放轻，并没有因此撤回，仍愿意把这份靠近继续带着。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"首段没有既有History；这里把“想靠近某个人、又不想让最初的冲动一下子说尽这份心意”作为本条Thread的起点。\",\"bridge\":\"没有前史需要搭因果桥；当前音乐只支持把这份心意理解为先鲜明出现、随后收敛而持续存在，不能据此推断对方有任何回应。\",\"current\":\"因此现在不是单纯的热烈或退缩，而是靠近的愿望已经出现，同时被放轻、延续，没有被一次性的显露耗尽。\",\"without\":\"这是首段，删去不存在的前述事实不会形成另一种解释；本段负责建立起点，而非解释既有经历的后果。\"},\"used\":[],\"new_history\":[\"他此刻确实带着一份想靠近某个人的心意；这份心意在最初明显涌起后仍继续存在，即使表达随即放轻。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":false,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"首段无History可发挥因果作用，因此history_effective为false；没有把力度变化当成外部回应，只据此建立一个具体但轻量的人类关切作为Thread起点。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3aef8ca2-9298-462f-ac5e-9bd5d45b61dc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215023282028Z", "elapsed_seconds": 16.515, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:50:39.799446+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6206ef2b8621aedb45414fff985b9db888b2023322e9f375a5933a30bbb7ede6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sh